Z||000014||rogergarrison||06-22-2001||10:29 AM||||go to an auto paint supply. They have a coating for vinyl bumper covers that sprays a textured coat that looks very much like pattern in vinyl. I had smooth fiberglass door panels and that what I did to them, then just painted over it. There hard, but look just like vinyl and it wont shrink or tear. I buy it by the quart, but they prob have spray cans too.||||reg||1
